OL,12,G2300 Coronation Street 60 Unforgettable
OL,13,G     Years
OL,14,     FOn 9th December 1960, the first
OL,15,     Fepisode of a new serial drama was
OL,16,     Fbroadcast on ITV. Coronation
OL,17,     FStreet would go on to become the
OL,18,     Flongest-running soap opera in the
OL,19,     Fworld.
